# ---- Real Google login (recommended, free, 10 minutes) ----
# 1. Go to https://console.firebase.google.com -> Add project (no Analytics needed)
# 2. Build -> Authentication -> Sign-in method -> Enable "Google"
# 3. Project Settings -> General -> Your apps -> Web app -> copy the 3 values:
NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_API_KEY=
NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_AUTH_DOMAIN=your-project.firebaseapp.com
NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID=your-project-id
# 4. In Firebase console: Authentication -> Settings -> Authorized domains -> ADD your Vercel domain
# 5. Add the same 3 keys in Vercel: Project -> Settings -> Environment Variables -> Redeploy
# Without these keys the site uses demo email login (still fully functional).

# ---- Instant push via FCM (optional upgrade, in addition to polling) ----
# FCM_SERVER_KEY=

# ---- Persistent DB instead of /tmp JSON (optional upgrade) ----
# KV_REST_API_URL=
# KV_REST_API_TOKEN=
